---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { socialLinks } from "../config";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
---

<Base>
  <section>
    <a href={socialLinks.twitter} target="_blank">
      <Image
        src="/profile.png"
        alt="Profile photo"
        class="rounded-full bg-gray-100 block lg:mt-5 mt-0 lg:mb-5 mb-10 mx-auto sm:float-right sm:ml-5 sm:mb-5"
        width={160}
        height={160}
      />
    </a>

    <h1 class="mb-8 text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight">
      About Me
    </h1>

    <div class="prose prose-neutral dark:prose-invert">
      <p>
        I am a dedicated and driven undergraduate student pursuing a Bachelor of Science in Biological Sciences at the University of Maryland, College Park, with an expected graduation in May 2026. As a Dean's List student with a 3.94 GPA, I am passionate about scientific research and solving complex biological problems.      </p>
      <p>
        Currently, I am an Undergraduate Research Assistant in the Jinwoo Lee Lab, investigating the Junín Virus glycoprotein complex to understand its role in viral entry. My technical skills include Python and R for bioinformatics, as well as genomic analysis tools like BLAST and Glimmer. This academic work is complemented by hands-on clinical experience from volunteering at the Greater Baltimore Medical Center.        </a>
      </p>
      <p>
       I am committed to hands-on experience in clinical and academic environments. I have a strong foundation in biological sciences and a passion for research and healthcare.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a
  
      </p>
      <p>
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
